DDD News						-*- text -*-
********

DDD-3.5.0 (Fiordland)
=====================

New Features
------------
Added data display with a pixel inspector powered by Gnuplot.
    Supports OpenCV, CImg, dlib, Eigen, Armadillo, ImageLib, and user-defined
    image structures.
    Improve graph scaling and add mini-map for navigation.

Add high resolution icons and source code glyphs.

Add source view syntax highlighting and coloring.

Add source code tabs.

Add command line option (--dlog) to generate log file.

Add "Reload" option to File menu.

Modernized graphical user interface.

Add .ddd/settings.xml file for non-GUI configuration settings.


Enhancements
------------
Use client-side X fonts (FreeType 2) instead of server side fonts.

Improvements in font selection menus.

Dark mode added.

Increase/decrease font size in Source view using Ctrl+< and Ctrl+>.

Improved style for status bar, scrollbars, other widgets, add classic Motif style.

Use UTF-8 symbols in Motif resources.

Updated user manual.

Improve application support for Gnome.

Replace panner in graph window with mini-map.


Miscellaneous
------------
Remove requirement for Athena Widgets (libXaw).

Alternative icons and splash screen.

New configure option: --with-xdg-datadir.

Remove rarely used options (status at top, toolbars at bottom).

Remove panner in graph window, replace with mini-map.

C++17 now required to build DDD.

Save default.xml in install share directory.

Update splash screen to ddd-3.5.

Added metainfo.xml file.

Internal improvements:
  Generate backtrace on segfault
  Replace private classes with C++ STL classes.
  Improve application support for Gnome.
  Internal reorganization of GDB support code.

Bugs fixed:
#66124: Missing header AppData.h without Athena support
#66082: Missing basename.h include in SourceCode.h
#66125: Problems with session management after restart
#66175: Breakpoint property dialog errors
#66186: FreeBSD bug in FreeType search
#66393: Undefined reference to app_data
#66998: Icons too small
#68155: CommandTool repositioned when Data Window opened/closed
#68290: GDB 7.1+ current-line arrow prefix "=>" makes find_pc() fail
#66186: FreeBSD configure/Makefile freetype error
#66199: FreeBSD "waiting until GDB gets ready"
#66394: /etc/prereq fail on Debian
#66998: Icons very small
#67243: DDD segfaults during startup
#68155: CommandTool repositioned when Data Window opened/closed



DDD-3.4.1 (Serengeti)
=====================

Enhancements
------------
Font handling has been redesigned to use XFT client-side fonts.  The font 
preference menu now has a drop-down menu to select compatible fonts.

Add side-by-side view for source and data.

Line number width adapts to the size of source file.

Display of UTF-8 in source window and debugger console.

Convert ddd.1 (ddd.man) to UTF-8.

Change default editors gvim or emacs, instead of kdevelop and vi in xterm.

Remove Make and Edit buttons from Tool Bar.

Fix dialogs for register, breakpoints, displays.


Build issues
------------
Several issues which prevented building on macOS have been resolved.

DDD is now built with internal X11 default attributes, vsl definitions.
Several --enable-builtin-x options removed.  

Additional derived files are built in the build directory instead of 
the source directory.

Support parallel make (-j <n>).  

Eliminate unneeded functions and headers.

Cleanup and reorganization in multiple areas: M4 use in Makefile, GDBAgent.

Correct prereq script for Ubuntu/Debian.


Miscelaneous
------------
Obsolete files have been removed: PROBLEMS, ddd.spec, GDB manual, FONTS

Update splash screen to ddd-3.4

DDD Reference manual is available under Help menu. 

Documents are now in doc directory in distribution tarball and
are installed in /usr/share/ddd-<version>/doc.

Bugs fixed:
#25109, All-registers display doesn't work
#28923: ddd/Ddd gets overwritten by ddd/ddd when building on os x (r7479)
#50156: ddd error on i386-apple-darwin15.6.0 
#65738: Xt error (Unresolved inheritance operation) on launch on macOS (fix upstream macOS)
#63928: Resource mismanagement causes DDD/GDB interaction to hang
#64188: ddd 3.4.0 fails to build on macOS without HAVE_SYS_IOCTL_H (r7364)
#64283: INSTALL refers to incorrect file etc/install-prereq (r7368)
#64321: HAVE_FNCTL_H never defined (r7366)
#64322: Splash screen has version '3.3' (r7365)
#64394: Wrong encoding for version output
#64398: Empty ddd.1 manpage generated and installed on OS X 10.8 and later
#64586: FONTS file is missing (r7472)
#64587: mouse wheel in data display
#65454: termcap compatible library may be called tinfo (r7471)
#65455: Fails to build with parallel make (r7469)
#65456: Build fails with LTO 

